{"games":[{"id":17601705136,"name":"Tycoon RNG","desc":"Build the factory of your dreams! One roll at a time...\n\nJoin Private Servers for Reduced Lag, they are FREE!\n\nOur take on the RNG genre lets you roll for all sorts of Droppers, Upgraders, and Furnaces to help you Build a Tycoon that you can flex off to other Players!\n\nRare Collectibles Spawning on the islands can be picked up and used in insane combos that give you OP boosts.\n\nJoin our Community Server for Updates!\n\nThis game is in ALPHA! We may mess up sometimes, but we'll try our best to make the best game possible!","path":"/game/17601705136-tycoon-rng","slug":"17601705136-tycoon-rng","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c1e785001491ca1c0ca0d9924b1ba85aea357ef7662bd4e6cb51fb76a0e938b2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-86b08d56d32c64abac194d4d04bcf53b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":40774746,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-15T16:53:57.087Z","creator":{"name":"Tycoon RNG 99","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":17,"freeCount":17,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12510873298,"name":"Project: Newtime 2","desc":"Project: Newtime is a derivative of the original game Poppy Playtime Escape From Playtime on Steam.\n\n🕹️:\n- Solve the puzzle pillars\n- Assemble the toy parts\n- Escape through the train\n- Monster prevents survivors from escaping\n- Earn rewards playing, complete missions\n\n✨The game will be updated soon (there's only one person working on updates).\n🎮All credits and rights are solely owned by MOB Games.\n\n🔨Map Creator: @Mugi\n📜Game Scripter: @Kaiolli0","path":"/game/12510873298-project-newtime-2","slug":"12510873298-project-newtime-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/43a4de81f3e8b571d1b80df47620f339e72857fa965d32bb8655509cbe9a8046.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fea1629bc66491d4f22d3e702676e5cc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":75305599,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-03-15T12:31:59.054Z","creator":{"name":"KaioWithK","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":18450282790,"name":"[🌹] Steal Time Simulator","desc":"<◆><◇><◆><◇><◆><◇><◆><◇><◆><◇><◆><◇>\n\n⚔️ Fight players, steal their time and enjoy an intense battle with classic sword fighting mechanics. Collect rare items around the map and find your way to the top!\n\n💡 HOW IT WORKS 💡\n\n• Leave the safe zone to start gaining time\n• Defeat other players to steal their time\n• Spend time to open cases and unlock swords\n• Stronger swords = faster time farming\n\n🎮 FEATURES 🎮\n\n🗡️ | PvP Sword Combat\n⏰ | Time-Stealing Gameplay\n📦 | Case Opening System\n💎 | Rare & Tradeable Swords\n🏆 | Leaderboards & Progression\n🥶 | Chill, fight, or troll — your choice\n\n<◆><◇><◆><◇><◆><◇><◆><◇><◆><◇><◆><◇>\n\n🤝 Join our Community Server for updates, help, codes, and giveaways!\n\n(The game is discontinued and will no longer receive updates)","path":"/game/18450282790-steal-time-simulator","slug":"18450282790-steal-time-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d7ed9014949aeaa2a9dafd030c834460bc9674943767d617fb35266aef75c9e1.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-5d7fef94fc5e459d1e13d3fef4ddf883/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":18289553,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-24T19:37:04.658Z","creator":{"name":"Silux Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9447079542,"name":"UPDATE 1🔥 [PM]","desc":"Shikai Call Names:\n\nHowl,Bloom,Roar,Devour,Scatter,Reap,Dance,Fly,Awake,Dash,Burst,Sing,Growl\n\nEx: Sing, Senbonzakura\n\nDefault Keybinds (Changeable):\nBackpack - L\nAir Walk = T\nDash = Q\nReiatsu = R\nMenu = M\nMeditate = K\nLeft Combo = M1\nRun = LeftShift\nMouse Lock = LeftControl\n\nTO NOTE:\nReiatsu and health are based on your player level, while the ignition bar is based on your spiritual standing / meditation progression.\n\nrace progression, zanpakuto progression and meditation progression is not viable to see unless the associated gamepasses have been purchased.\n\nAFK WORLD REWARDS ARE DOUBLED WITH ROBLOX PREMIUM, EXCEPT FOR LEGENDARY ORBS","path":"/game/9447079542-update-1-pm","slug":"9447079542-update-1-pm","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/913cd7f475d52c6adaddd9f5b1568137ae5e0bfb45c8c0e3fc6fb76befe04c26.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-55f6ae0d4dcaba397538a6af06b9244c/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":87093781,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-06-15T19:55:58.865Z","creator":{"name":"Osiris Productions","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":4733728555,"name":"SCP: Site-43 RP FR","desc":"SCP: Site-43 | RP FR\n\nImagine a universe where creatures and paranormal phenomena truly exist. In this universe, an organization would have been created to hide them from the eyes of the population and to avoid causing widespread panic.\nThis organization is the SCP Foundation.\nThe SCP Foundation would gather several sites around the world, most of which would aim to contain these paranormal creatures.\n\nIn this French game, you can play as a staff member (guard, scientist, doctor) or become an enemy, and try to free the creatures, called < SCP >.\n\nRules: devforum.roblox.com/t/1472624","path":"/game/4733728555-scp-site-43-rp-fr","slug":"4733728555-scp-site-43-rp-fr","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8eae99049fd85af4e27380c2f5d825f492ed116bbc94757afc7120107883a5e3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-bcdef1a5cccc88814db1683317734f7e/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":14,"visitor":3397240,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-03T08:10:00.756Z","creator":{"name":"Studio Baguette","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5209284442,"name":"Vehicle Suspension Test [200+ Vehicles]","desc":"🔥 MEGA RAMPS UPDATE! 36 new ramps, ski jumps, half pipes and a brand new menu!\n\nTest 140 cars, d